{"v":[{"a":["حمٓ"],"t":"Ha, Meem","l":"Ha-Mim","w":[["hha-meem","Ha Meem"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡكِتَٰبِ","ٱلۡمُبِينِ"],"t":"By the Enlightening Scripture","l":"Wa Al-Kitabi Al-Mubini","w":[["wal-kitābi","By the Book"],["l-mubīni","the clear"]]},{"a":["إِنَّآ","أَنزَلۡنَٰهُ","فِي","لَيۡلَةٖ","مُّبَٰرَكَةٍۚ","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","مُنذِرِينَ"],"t":"We have revealed it on a Blessed Night—We have warned","l":"Inna 'Anzalnahu Fi Laylatin Mubarakatin 'Inna Kunna Mundhirina","w":[["innā","Indeed, We"],["anzalnāhu","revealed it"],["fī","in"],["laylatin","a Night"],["mubārakatin","Blessed"],["innā","Indeed, We"],["kunnā","[We] are"],["mundhirīna","(ever) warning"]]},{"a":["فِيهَا","يُفۡرَقُ","كُلُّ","أَمۡرٍ","حَكِيمٍ"],"t":"In it is distinguished every wise command","l":"Fiha Yufraqu Kullu 'Amrin Hakimin","w":[["fīhā","Therein"],["yuf'raqu","is made distinct"],["kullu","every"],["amrin","affair"],["ḥakīmin","wise"]]},{"a":["أَمۡرٗا","مِّنۡ","عِندِنَآۚ","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","مُرۡسِلِينَ"],"t":"A decree from Us. We have been sending messages","l":"Amraan Min `Indina 'Inna Kunna Mursilina","w":[["amran","A command"],["min","from"],["ʿindinā","Us"],["innā","Indeed, We"],["kunnā","[We] are"],["mur'silīna","(ever) sending"]]},{"a":["رَحۡمَةٗ","مِّن","رَّبِّكَۚ","إِنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","ٱلسَّمِيعُ","ٱلۡعَلِيمُ"],"t":"As mercy from your Lord. He is the Hearer, the Knower","l":"Rahmatan Min Rabbika 'Innahu Huwa As-Sami`u Al-`Alimu","w":[["raḥmatan","As Mercy"],["min","from"],["rabbika","your Lord"],["innahu","Indeed, He"],["huwa","[He]"],["l-samīʿu","(is) the All-Hearer"],["l-ʿalīmu","the All-Knower"]]},{"a":["رَبِّ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ","وَمَا","بَيۡنَهُمَآۖ","إِن","كُنتُم","مُّوقِنِينَ"],"t":"Lord of the heavens and the earth and what is between them, if you know for sure","l":"Rabbi As-Samawati Wa Al-'Arđi Wa Ma Baynahuma 'In Kuntum Muqinina","w":[["rabbi","Lord"],["l-samāwāti","(of) the heavens"],["wal-arḍi","and the earth"],["wamā","and whatever"],["baynahumā","(is) between both of them"],["in","if"],["kuntum","you are"],["mūqinīna","certain"]]},{"a":["لَآ","إِلَٰهَ","إِلَّا","هُوَ","يُحۡيِۦ","وَيُمِيتُۖ","رَبُّكُمۡ","وَرَبُّ","ءَابَآئِكُمُ","ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ"],"t":"There is no god but He. He gives life and causes death—your Lord and Lord of your ancestors of old","l":"La 'Ilaha 'Illa Huwa Yuhyi Wa Yumitu Rabbukum Wa Rabbu 'Aba'ikumu Al-'Awwalina","w":[["lā","(There is) no"],["ilāha","god"],["illā","except"],["huwa","Him"],["yuḥ'yī","He gives life"],["wayumītu","and causes death"],["rabbukum","your Lord"],["warabbu","and (the) Lord"],["ābāikumu","(of) your fathers"],["l-awalīna","the former"]]},{"a":["بَلۡ","هُمۡ","فِي","شَكّٖ","يَلۡعَبُونَ"],"t":"Yet they play around in doubt","l":"Bal Hum Fi Shakkin Yal`abuna","w":[["bal","Nay"],["hum","they"],["fī","(are) in"],["shakkin","doubt "],["yalʿabūna","playing"]]},{"a":["فَٱرۡتَقِبۡ","يَوۡمَ","تَأۡتِي","ٱلسَّمَآءُ","بِدُخَانٖ","مُّبِينٖ"],"t":"So watch out for the Day when the sky produces a visible smoke","l":"Fartaqib Yawma Ta'ti As-Sama'u Bidukhanin Mubinin","w":[["fa-ir'taqib","Then watch"],["yawma","(for the) Day"],["tatī","(when) will bring"],["l-samāu","the sky"],["bidukhānin","smoke"],["mubīnin","visible"]]},{"a":["يَغۡشَى","ٱلنَّاسَۖ","هَٰذَا","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٞ"],"t":"Enveloping mankind; this is a painful punishment","l":"Yaghsha An-Nasa Hadha `Adhabun 'Alimun","w":[["yaghshā","Enveloping"],["l-nāsa","the people"],["hādhā","This"],["ʿadhābun","(will be) a punishment"],["alīmun","painful"]]},{"a":["رَّبَّنَا","ٱكۡشِفۡ","عَنَّا","ٱلۡعَذَابَ","إِنَّا","مُؤۡمِنُونَ"],"t":"“Our Lord, lift the torment from us, we are believers.”","l":"Rabbana Akshif `Anna Al-`Adhaba 'Inna Mu'uminuna","w":[["rabbanā","Our Lord"],["ik'shif","Remove"],["ʿannā","from us"],["l-ʿadhāba","the punishment"],["innā","indeed, we"],["mu'minūna","(are) believers"]]},{"a":["أَنَّىٰ","لَهُمُ","ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰ","وَقَدۡ","جَآءَهُمۡ","رَسُولٞ","مُّبِينٞ"],"t":"But how can they be reminded? An enlightening messenger has already come to them","l":"Anna Lahumu Adh-Dhikra Wa Qad Ja'ahum Rasulun Mubinun","w":[["annā","How can"],["lahumu","(there be) for them"],["l-dhik'rā","the reminder"],["waqad","when verily"],["jāahum","had come to them"],["rasūlun","a Messenger"],["mubīnun","clear"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","تَوَلَّوۡاْ","عَنۡهُ","وَقَالُواْ","مُعَلَّمٞ","مَّجۡنُونٌ"],"t":"But they turned away from him, and said, “Educated, but crazy!”","l":"Thumma Tawallaw `Anhu Wa Qalu Mu`allamun Majnunun","w":[["thumma","Then"],["tawallaw","they turned away"],["ʿanhu","from him"],["waqālū","and said"],["muʿallamun","One taught"],["majnūnun","a mad man"]]},{"a":["إِنَّا","كَاشِفُواْ","ٱلۡعَذَابِ","قَلِيلًاۚ","إِنَّكُمۡ","عَآئِدُونَ"],"t":"We will ease the punishment a little, but you will revert","l":"Inna Kashifu Al-`Adhabi Qalilaan 'Innakum `A'iduna","w":[["innā","Indeed, We"],["kāshifū","(will) remove"],["l-ʿadhābi","the punishment"],["qalīlan","a little"],["innakum","indeed, you"],["ʿāidūna","(will) return"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","نَبۡطِشُ","ٱلۡبَطۡشَةَ","ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰٓ","إِنَّا","مُنتَقِمُونَ"],"t":"The Day when We launch the Great Assault—We will avenge","l":"Yawma Nabtishu Al-Batshata Al-Kubra 'Inna Muntaqimuna","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["nabṭishu","We will seize"],["l-baṭshata","(with) the seizure"],["l-kub'rā","the greatest"],["innā","indeed, We"],["muntaqimūna","(will) take retribution"]]},{"a":["۞وَلَقَدۡ","فَتَنَّا","قَبۡلَهُمۡ","قَوۡمَ","فِرۡعَوۡنَ","وَجَآءَهُمۡ","رَسُولٞ","كَرِيمٌ"],"t":"Before them We tested the people of Pharaoh; a noble messenger came to them","l":"Wa Laqad Fatanna Qablahum Qawma Fir`awna Wa Ja'ahum Rasulun Karimun","w":[["walaqad","And certainly"],["fatannā","We tried"],["qablahum","before them"],["qawma","(the) people"],["fir'ʿawna","(of) Firaun"],["wajāahum","and came to them"],["rasūlun","a Messenger"],["karīmun","noble"]]},{"a":["أَنۡ","أَدُّوٓاْ","إِلَيَّ","عِبَادَ","ٱللَّهِۖ","إِنِّي","لَكُمۡ","رَسُولٌ","أَمِينٞ"],"t":"Saying, “Hand over God’s servants to me. I am an honest messenger to you.”","l":"An 'Addu 'Ilayya `Ibada Allahi 'Inni Lakum Rasulun 'Aminun","w":[["an","That"],["addū","Deliver"],["ilayya","to me"],["ʿibāda","(the) servants"],["l-lahi","(of) Allah"],["innī","Indeed, I am"],["lakum","to you"],["rasūlun","a Messenger"],["amīnun","trustworthy"]]},{"a":["وَأَن","لَّا","تَعۡلُواْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِۖ","إِنِّيٓ","ءَاتِيكُم","بِسُلۡطَٰنٖ","مُّبِينٖ"],"t":"And, “Do not exalt yourselves above God. I come to you with clear authority","l":"Wa 'An La Ta`lu `Ala Allahi 'Inni 'Atikum Bisultanin Mubinin","w":[["wa-an","And that"],["lā","(do) not"],["taʿlū","exalt yourselves"],["ʿalā","against"],["l-lahi","Allah"],["innī","Indeed, I"],["ātīkum","[I] have come to you"],["bisul'ṭānin","with an authority"],["mubīnin","clear"]]},{"a":["وَإِنِّي","عُذۡتُ","بِرَبِّي","وَرَبِّكُمۡ","أَن","تَرۡجُمُونِ"],"t":"I have taken refuge in my Lord and your Lord, lest you stone me","l":"Wa 'Inni `Udhtu Birabbi Wa Rabbikum 'An Tarjumuni","w":[["wa-innī","And indeed, I"],["ʿudh'tu","[I] seek refuge"],["birabbī","with my Lord"],["warabbikum","and your Lord"],["an","lest"],["tarjumūni","you stone me"]]},{"a":["وَإِن","لَّمۡ","تُؤۡمِنُواْ","لِي","فَٱعۡتَزِلُونِ"],"t":"But if you do not believe in me, keep away from me.”","l":"Wa 'In Lam Tu'uminu Li Fa`taziluni","w":[["wa-in","And if"],["lam","not"],["tu'minū","you believe"],["lī","me"],["fa-iʿ'tazilūni","then leave me alone"]]},{"a":["فَدَعَا","رَبَّهُۥٓ","أَنَّ","هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","قَوۡمٞ","مُّجۡرِمُونَ"],"t":"He appealed to his Lord: “These are a sinful people.”","l":"Fada`a Rabbahu 'Anna Ha'uula' Qawmun Mujrimuna","w":[["fadaʿā","So he called"],["rabbahu","his Lord"],["anna","That"],["hāulāi","these"],["qawmun","(are) a people"],["muj'rimūna","criminals"]]},{"a":["فَأَسۡرِ","بِعِبَادِي","لَيۡلًا","إِنَّكُم","مُّتَّبَعُونَ"],"t":"“Set out with My servants by night—you will be followed","l":"Fa'asri Bi`ibadi Laylaan 'Innakum Muttaba`una","w":[["fa-asri","Then \"Set out"],["biʿibādī","with My slaves"],["laylan","(by) night"],["innakum","Indeed, you"],["muttabaʿūna","(will be) followed"]]},{"a":["وَٱتۡرُكِ","ٱلۡبَحۡرَ","رَهۡوًاۖ","إِنَّهُمۡ","جُندٞ","مُّغۡرَقُونَ"],"t":"And cross the sea quickly; they are an army to be drowned.”","l":"Wa Atruki Al-Bahra Rahwan 'Innahum Jundun Mughraquna","w":[["wa-ut'ruki","And leave"],["l-baḥra","the sea"],["rahwan","at rest"],["innahum","Indeed, they"],["jundun","(are) an army"],["mugh'raqūna","(to be) drowned"]]},{"a":["كَمۡ","تَرَكُواْ","مِن","جَنَّـٰتٖ","وَعُيُونٖ"],"t":"How many gardens and fountains did they leave behind","l":"Kam Taraku Min Jannatin Wa `Uyunin","w":[["kam","How many"],["tarakū","(did) they leave"],["min","of"],["jannātin","gardens"],["waʿuyūnin","and springs"]]},{"a":["وَزُرُوعٖ","وَمَقَامٖ","كَرِيمٖ"],"t":"And plantations, and splendid buildings","l":"Wa Zuru`in Wa Maqamin Karimin","w":[["wazurūʿin","And cornfields"],["wamaqāmin","and places"],["karīmin","noble"]]},{"a":["وَنَعۡمَةٖ","كَانُواْ","فِيهَا","فَٰكِهِينَ"],"t":"And comforts they used to enjoy","l":"Wa Na`matin Kanu Fiha Fakihina","w":[["wanaʿmatin","And pleasant things"],["kānū","they used to"],["fīhā","therein"],["fākihīna","take delight"]]},{"a":["كَذَٰلِكَۖ","وَأَوۡرَثۡنَٰهَا","قَوۡمًا","ءَاخَرِينَ"],"t":"So it was; and We passed it on to another people","l":"Kadhalika Wa 'Awrathnaha Qawmaan 'Akharina","w":[["kadhālika","Thus"],["wa-awrathnāhā","And We made it (an) inherit(ance)"],["qawman","(for) a people"],["ākharīna","another"]]},{"a":["فَمَا","بَكَتۡ","عَلَيۡهِمُ","ٱلسَّمَآءُ","وَٱلۡأَرۡضُ","وَمَا","كَانُواْ","مُنظَرِينَ"],"t":"Neither heaven nor earth wept over them, nor were they reprieved","l":"Fama Bakat `Alayhimu As-Sama'u Wa Al-'Arđu Wa Ma Kanu Munzarina","w":[["famā","And not"],["bakat","wept"],["ʿalayhimu","for them"],["l-samāu","the heaven"],["wal-arḍu","and the earth"],["wamā","and not"],["kānū","they were"],["munẓarīna","given respite"]]},{"a":["وَلَقَدۡ","نَجَّيۡنَا","بَنِيٓ","إِسۡرَـٰٓءِيلَ","مِنَ","ٱلۡعَذَابِ","ٱلۡمُهِينِ"],"t":"And We delivered the Children of Israel from the humiliating persecution","l":"Wa Laqad Najjayna Bani 'Isra'ila Mina Al-`Adhabi Al-Muhini","w":[["walaqad","And certainly"],["najjaynā","We saved"],["banī","(the) Children of Israel"],["is'rāīla","(the) Children of Israel"],["mina","from"],["l-ʿadhābi","the punishment"],["l-muhīni","the humiliating"]]},{"a":["مِن","فِرۡعَوۡنَۚ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","عَالِيٗا","مِّنَ","ٱلۡمُسۡرِفِينَ"],"t":"From Pharaoh. He was a transgressing tyrant","l":"Min Fir`awna 'Innahu Kana `Aliaan Mina Al-Musrifina","w":[["min","From"],["fir'ʿawna","Firaun"],["innahu","Indeed, he"],["kāna","was"],["ʿāliyan","arrogant"],["mina","among"],["l-mus'rifīna","the transgressors"]]},{"a":["وَلَقَدِ","ٱخۡتَرۡنَٰهُمۡ","عَلَىٰ","عِلۡمٍ","عَلَى","ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ"],"t":"And We chose them knowingly over all other people","l":"Wa Laqadi Akhtarnahum `Ala `Ilmin `Ala Al-`Alamina","w":[["walaqadi","And certainly"],["ikh'tarnāhum","We chose them"],["ʿalā","by"],["ʿil'min","knowledge"],["ʿalā","over"],["l-ʿālamīna","the worlds"]]},{"a":["وَءَاتَيۡنَٰهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلۡأٓيَٰتِ","مَا","فِيهِ","بَلَـٰٓؤٞاْ","مُّبِينٌ"],"t":"And We gave them many signs, in which was an obvious test","l":"Wa 'Ataynahum Mina Al-'Ayati Ma Fihi Bala'un Mubinun","w":[["waātaynāhum","And We gave them"],["mina","of"],["l-āyāti","the Signs"],["mā","that"],["fīhi","in it"],["balāon","(was) a trial"],["mubīnun","clear"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","لَيَقُولُونَ"],"t":"These people say","l":"Inna Ha'uula' Layaquluna","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["hāulāi","these"],["layaqūlūna","surely, they say"]]},{"a":["إِنۡ","هِيَ","إِلَّا","مَوۡتَتُنَا","ٱلۡأُولَىٰ","وَمَا","نَحۡنُ","بِمُنشَرِينَ"],"t":"“There is nothing but our first death, and we will not be resurrected","l":"In Hiya 'Illa Mawtatuna Al-'Ula Wa Ma Nahnu Bimunsharina","w":[["in","Not"],["hiya","it"],["illā","(is) but"],["mawtatunā","our death"],["l-ūlā","the first"],["wamā","and not"],["naḥnu","we"],["bimunsharīna","(will be) raised again"]]},{"a":["فَأۡتُواْ","بِـَٔابَآئِنَآ","إِن","كُنتُمۡ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"t":"Bring back our ancestors, if you are truthful.”","l":"Fa'tu Bi'aba'ina 'In Kuntum Sadiqina","w":[["fatū","Then bring"],["biābāinā","our forefathers"],["in","if"],["kuntum","you are"],["ṣādiqīna","truthful"]]},{"a":["أَهُمۡ","خَيۡرٌ","أَمۡ","قَوۡمُ","تُبَّعٖ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبۡلِهِمۡ","أَهۡلَكۡنَٰهُمۡۚ","إِنَّهُمۡ","كَانُواْ","مُجۡرِمِينَ"],"t":"Are they better, or the people of Tubba and those before them? We annihilated them. They were evildoers","l":"Ahum Khayrun 'Am Qawmu Tubba`in Wa Al-Ladhina Min Qablihim 'Ahlaknahum 'Innahum Kanu Mujrimina","w":[["ahum","Are they"],["khayrun","better"],["am","or"],["qawmu","(the) people"],["tubbaʿin","(of) Tubba"],["wa-alladhīna","and those"],["min","before them"],["qablihim","before them"],["ahlaknāhum","We destroyed them"],["innahum","indeed, they"],["kānū","were"],["muj'rimīna","criminals"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","خَلَقۡنَا","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ","وَمَا","بَيۡنَهُمَا","لَٰعِبِينَ"],"t":"We did not create the heavens and the earth and what is between them to play","l":"Wa Ma Khalaqna As-Samawati Wa Al-'Arđa Wa Ma Baynahuma La`ibina","w":[["wamā","And not"],["khalaqnā","We created"],["l-samāwāti","the heavens"],["wal-arḍa","and the earth"],["wamā","and whatever"],["baynahumā","(is) between them"],["lāʿibīna","(in) play"]]},{"a":["مَا","خَلَقۡنَٰهُمَآ","إِلَّا","بِٱلۡحَقِّ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","أَكۡثَرَهُمۡ","لَا","يَعۡلَمُونَ"],"t":"We created them only for a specific purpose, but most of them do not know","l":"Ma Khalaqnahuma 'Illa Bil-Haqqi Wa Lakinna 'Aktharahum La Ya`lamuna","w":[["mā","Not"],["khalaqnāhumā","We created both of them"],["illā","but"],["bil-ḥaqi","in [the] truth"],["walākinna","but"],["aktharahum","most of them"],["lā","(do) not"],["yaʿlamūna","know"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","يَوۡمَ","ٱلۡفَصۡلِ","مِيقَٰتُهُمۡ","أَجۡمَعِينَ"],"t":"The Day of Sorting Out is the appointed time for them all","l":"Inna Yawma Al-Fasli Miqatuhum 'Ajma`ina","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["yawm